              "value": "Hey {{first_name}}, I understand you're looking for tennis lessons - I'm {{rep_first_name}}, your dedicated account manager at PlayYourCourt. Let me know when you can chat or text to review coaches and hear how this works. You can text me or call me at {{rep_phone}}. Would you like to see coach options now? ... Also, I'm a real person, but if you don't want me to text you, just reply stop."
